{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "537d1ea7-dfaf-8236-8332-e48203fa6ed6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:31:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:28:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I got a pothole to report. Big one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty Farewell Street. North End. Right out front of the building, more or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty Farewell Street. And is it in the travel lane, or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in the bike lane. Along the edge there. Anybody on a bike hits that, they're going over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deep. Deep enough to swallow a tire. I'm not exaggerating. Car tire, easy. Been watching cars swerve around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So a deep pothole in the bike lane at sixty Farewell Street, big enough that a tire could drop right in. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has it been there a while, or did it just show up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Couple weeks it's been getting worse. Freeze and thaw, I guess. That's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is that time of year. Let me put that in. Do you want a call back if the crew has an update, or are you all set?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, I don't need a call. Can I get a reference number though? For the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Give me one second, I'm just finishing the entry. [pause] Okay, it's coming up now. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, I'll remember it. Actually, hang on, I'm walking. Let me stop. Okay, go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's P-W, then zero, four, one, seven, two. So P-W zero four one seven two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P-W zero four one seven two. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And that's attached to the location, sixty Farewell, bike lane, deep pothole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Any idea when somebody gets out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews work through the list by location and how bad it is. A hole that deep in a bike lane will get flagged. I'd say within the next week or so, weather permitting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Long as it's on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the list. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. I got to get going, my parents are coming for dinner and I still have to get stuff at the store."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, then don't let me keep you. Enjoy your dinner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:31:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Appreciate it. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, George. Bye now."
    }
  ],
